# FarmaCorp Data

This folder contains the corpora that form part of the **FarmaCorp project**, a Spanish–English resource for the pharmacological domain.

The corpora include:
- **Comparable corpus** (original Spanish and English texts from pharmacological resources).
- **Parallel corpus** (aligned Spanish–English sentence pairs from MEDLINE and Ken Pharma).
- **Multimodal corpus** (video transcripts with Spanish and English speech).

Due to licensing and storage considerations, the data itself is not distributed within this repository.  
Instead, all corpora are publicly available through our Zenodo release:

[FarmaCorp on Zenodo](https://zenodo.org/records/17233158)

Please refer to the main project [README](../README.md) for details on preprocessing, alignment, and evaluation procedures.
